                    <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
                    <p>These terms govern the use of our website, courses, and educational services to ensure a professional, respectful, and beneficial learning experience for all students worldwide.</p>
                    <div class="am-page-actions">
                        <a class="green_btn" href="free-trial.aspx"><span>Book Free Trial</span></a>
                        <a class="am-page-text-link" href="inquiry.aspx">Have a question? <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
